  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/jVmUTGFMX5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1051116089133777016?color=green&label=Discord&logo=Discord&logoColor=green&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord Badge\"></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Just Another Xray</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">一款简单却强大的<strong>Xray材质包</strong>，旨在比大多数其他Xray材质包<strong>更优秀、更简洁</strong>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>🔍 特性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>作为<strong>材质包</strong>运行（无需安装模组）。</li>\n<li>清晰高亮矿石和重要方块。</li>\n<li>配合<strong>夜视药水</strong>或<strong>Optifine</strong>使用，可获得最佳亮度效果。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>📦 支持的模组</h2>\n<p>此材质包包含对以下多个模组的支持：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Adabranium</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Applied Energistics 2</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Astromine</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Enderite</strong></li>\n<li><strong>End Reborn</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Forestry</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Indrev</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Mekanism</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Mystical Agriculture</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Quark</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Tech Reborn</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Thaumcraft</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Immersive Ores</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Tardis Refined</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Palladium</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Create: New Age</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Fossils and Archeology: Revival</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Yttr</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Pastel</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Malum</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Stargate Journey</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Aether</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Tensura Reincarnated</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Xg's Story Mode</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Terramity</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Create</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RIG Tech</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Mana And Artifice</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fblocklegend001%253fr%253dCurseforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisect